🔴 P0 — Ye 2 cheezein core ko todti hain
1. Monaco CDN se load hota hai → offline desktop app mein editor hi nahi khulega
loader.config( ka poore project mein 0 match hai (src, electron, next.config — sab check kiya). Matlab @monaco-editor/react apne default path par chal raha hai, jo @monaco-editor/loader ke through jsDelivr CDN hai.

Aap monaco-editor ko dependency mein rakhte hain, par use locally wire nahi kiya.
Internet ke bina editor blank loading spinner par atak jayega.
Aap ek .exe desktop IDE ship kar rahe hain — offline use iska whole point hai. Ye #1 blocker hai.
Addon: loader.config({ monaco }) + local worker bundling. ~20 lines, sabse zyada impact.

2. Terminal mein PTY nahi hai → half-broken terminal
src/lib/shell.ts:39:

spawn("powershell.exe", ["-NoLogo", "-NoExit"], { ... })   // pipes, no PTY
node-pty package.json mein nahi hai (node_modules mein transitive mila, par use nahi hota).

Kya todega: vim/nano/htop, interactive prompts, password input, npm login, git rebase -i, npx create-* ke questions, ANSI colors, terminal resize. xterm.js installed hai par usko feed karne ke liye proper PTY chahiye.

Addon: node-pty + xterm over WebSocket.

🟠 P1 — Daily use mein kha90tir rahega
3. Editor mein IntelliSense nahi (no types, no LSP)
monaco.languages.typescript.* ka koi config nahi, addExtraLib nahi. Matlab:

node_modules/@types load nahi hote → dependencies ke liye autocomplete nahi, React hooks ka IntelliSense nahi, hover docs nahi, cross-dependency go-to-definition nahi
Rename symbol, organize imports, code actions — kuch nahi
Sirf formatOnPaste: true hai (monaco-pane.tsx:196)
Monaco ka built-in TS service chalega, par wo tumhare project ke files tak seemit hai. Ye Cursor/VS Code se sabse bada practical farq hai.

4. Git panel adhoora — staging aur diff bilkul nahi
src/lib/git.ts mein sirf: gitStatus, gitLog, gitCommit, gitCommitAndPush, gitInit, gitPush, gitPull, gitSetRemote

Missing: per-file stage/unstage, discard changes, branch create/switch, stash, diff viewer, merge conflict UI, fetch, blame, revert, tags.

Panel sab kuch ek saath commit karta hai — literally title hai "All changes are included in the commit"
stage|unstage|discard|stash|checkout|blame|diff → git-panel mein 0 matches. Koi diff view nahi hai.
Diff viewer ke bina git panel daily use ke liye kaafi kamzor hai.

5. File watcher nahi — sab stale reh jata hai
chokidar install hai par use nahi hota, koi watcher nahi. Iska matlab:

Agent ne file badli → editor stale
Bahar se file change hui → IDE ko pata hi nahi
Git status / tree auto-refresh nahi
6. Search kamzor hai
src/lib/tools.ts:237-241 — hamesha new RegExp(query, "i"), matlab case-sensitive search ka option hi nahi. Aur MAX_SEARCH_HITS = 80.

Missing: case toggle, whole-word, include/exclude globs, replace / replace-all, per-file grouping + counts, pagination (80 ke baad results chup-chaap gayab). Search panel mein koi option UI nahi.

7. Command palette mein fuzzy matching nahi
command-palette.tsx → f.toLowerCase().includes(needle). Plain substring. srcid likhne par src/components/ide/... nahi milega — VS Code style subsequence matching nahi hai.

8. Formatter nahi
prettier installed nahi, format-on-save nahi. Code likha, format karne ka koi tareeka nahi (except paste).

