🔴 Security (dobara flag kar raha hoon)
Aapki API keys ~/.dovee/settings.json mein plaintext hain. Design theek hai (renderer ko sirf hasApiKey/apiKeyHint milta hai), par disk par plaintext rehna risk hai. Electron safeStorage ya OS keychain better hoga.

(Jaisa pichhle turn mein bataya — verification ke waqt ye keys tool output mein aa gayi thi, rotate kar lein.)

🎯 Mera recommended order
Sprint 1 (core ko theek karo):

Monaco local bundling (offline fix) — P0
node-pty terminal — P0
Sprint 2 (daily driver banao): 3. Git diff viewer + per-file staging 4. File watcher (tree/tabs/git auto-refresh) 5. Search options (case, globs, replace) 6. Formatter + format-on-save

Sprint 3 (polish): 7. Command palette fuzzy matching 8. Agent change diff view 9. Editor IntelliSense for deps (addExtraLib)

